<title>SOUTH AFRICA: BOLAND BANK FOLLOWS MARKET ON RATES.</title>
<headline>BOLAND BANK FOLLOWS MARKET ON RATES.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boland Bank PKS Ltd announced on Thursday that it had increased its prime rate to 20.25 percent from 19.25 percent and its home loan rate to 20.00 percent from 19.00 percent with immediate effect.</p>
<p>- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
